KG42.register("clusters-5fe1dc777995dc9ee18a310b",{"id":"41-data_center_local_markets::v142-d-CL001","paper":"41-data_center_local_markets","label":"Regional scope, buyer-seller roles and scenario permissions for local energy trading","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-CL001","label":"Regional scope, buyer-seller roles and scenario permissions for local energy trading","market_meaning":"The CSP purchases shortfall energy and sells surplus energy through the local market in the region where each IDC is located. Regional scope, trading object, buyer-seller roles and trading availability jointly define this permission; Case 2 disables local trading, and Case 3 retains local purchasing but does not allow selling. The three-region case scope of R001 is retained separately.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["participation","activation","bidding"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"The proposed framework, background participation roles and case branches complement each other only under their respective conditions. R001 is limited to the three-region case and is not elevated to a general access requirement; Case 2 and Case 3 are separately applicable scenarios and do not hold simultaneously with the proposed framework's bidirectional trading.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"With the availability of CSP local energy buying and selling as the boundary, combine regional, object, buyer and seller roles and activity permissions. The overlap of R004 with R005 and R006 belongs to activity and role facets of the same permission and is not counted as separate independent rules; this cluster does not claim that clearing or delivery has been completed.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R001","ownership":"primary","role":"support","rationale":"It provides the trading scope between IDCs and their regional markets in the three-region case, retaining the case limitation."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R004","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"It provides the buying and selling activity permissions of the proposed framework and the trading switches for Case 2 and Case 3."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R005","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"It completes the buyer role and whether local purchasing is available in each scenario, corresponding to the purchase branch of the activity chain."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R006","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"It completes the surplus-power supply role, facility conditions and whether selling is available in each scenario."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R008","ownership":"primary","role":"support","rationale":"It limits the energy object of the above buying and selling activities and does not extend to bidding or cleared-quantity rules."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL001-L001","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g02-E17","v141-b-g01-E04"],"rationale":"The IDC and local market arrangements in the system overview are concretely illustrated in the three-region case. This connection only supplements the case scope and does not infer general exclusive access or a cross-region trading prohibition from it."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL001-L002","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C002","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C003","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C004"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C002","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E04","v141-b-g02-E19"],"rationale":"Buyer participation corresponds scenario by scenario to the purchase branch of the trading activity: the proposed framework allows purchasing under power shortage, Case 2 disables local purchasing, and Case 3 retains local purchasing. This is a complementary description of roles and activities and does not add a transaction guarantee."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL001-L003","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C003"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C002","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E01","v141-b-g01-E04","v141-b-g02-E19"],"rationale":"The surplus-power supply role is complementary to the sales branch of the trading activity, and facility conditions are retained. Case 2's unsubsidized feedback to the grid and Case 3's local sales prohibition are retained separately and cannot be interchanged as general electricity sales rules."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CL001-L004","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E04"],"rationale":"The trading object corresponds explicitly to shortfall energy purchase and surplus energy sale in the activity; product identification and trading permission are complementary, and they are not judged as duplicate constraints on the basis of shared citations."}],"object_mappings":[],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL001-G001","category":"unverified_source","description":"The source_status of the evidence cited by this cluster all remains unverified; the experiment permits candidate support, but no B-source audit or C2 independent review has been implemented.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R004","v141-c-R005","v141-c-R006","v141-c-R008"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E01","v141-b-g01-E02","v141-b-g01-E03","v141-b-g01-E04","v141-b-g02-E17","v141-b-g02-E19"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually verify the citations, case conditions and regional scope, and check the boundary of this cluster; candidate eligibility must not be recorded as independent verification of the source or scientific content."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL001-G002","category":"ambiguous_mapping","description":"The framework definition of execution.energy_trade involves execution of cleared exchanges, but the citations of this chain only support trading capability and scenario switches; there is not yet a confirmed delivery procedure for concluded transactions. This cluster therefore interprets this chain only as trading permission.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R004"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R004::V::execution.energy_trade","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E04","v141-b-g02-E19"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually confirm the fit between the frozen node and the permission narrative; if it needs to be interpreted as transaction fulfillment, separate source support for transaction confirmation and delivery responsibility is required, and it cannot be fabricated by this assembly."}]},"rule_refs":["41-data_center_local_markets::v141-c-R001","41-data_center_local_markets::v141-c-R004","41-data_center_local_markets::v141-c-R005","41-data_center_local_markets::v141-c-R006","41-data_center_local_markets::v141-c-R008"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-14965fb0e8564001","COMP-7f5e3dcddfa1014c","COMP-e80c3b7a1946ecd1","KG40-e988fed52eadab03","KG40-f19328f0aeb3d626"]});
